#====================================================================
# DRAFT-metamath-standalone-c-cli-ohos-conan — OHOS Conan path for standalone C CLI tools
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-metamath-standalone-c-cli-ohos-conan
trigger_tool:           conan|build_and_test.sh|ohos-test-runner|clang
phase:                  preflight|build|package|shadow-ci
error_signature:        missing sysroot|unable to execute binary format|commands_json_r38|test_package.*can_run|/data/service/hnp/bin
severity:               2
category:               conan|cross-compile|cli-tool|ohos|test-package
match_keywords:         metamath, standalone C, OHOS, AArch64, sysroot, compiler_executables, application, commands.json, can_run, shadow CI
title:                  无外部依赖 C CLI 工具在 OHOS 上应采用显式 sysroot 交叉编译和设备闭环验证

root_cause:             传统 C CLI 归档可能只有源文件和可选的 Autotools 输入，没有生成构建文件、第三方依赖或自动化测试；DevEco clang 的绝对路径也不等于完整 OHOS 交叉编译环境。必须从 Conan profile 获取编译器，显式设置 OHOS target/sysroot/libc 宏，并将设备运行时检查与主机交叉编译检查分层。
affected_scope:         无第三方运行时依赖、提供 bin/ 可执行文件、源码可直接编译的 C/C++ CLI 工具，尤其是 Windows 主机交叉构建 OHOS AArch64 的包。
verification_cmd:       zsh ci/conan/build_and_test.sh archives/m/metamath/0.198

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           explicit-ohos-cross-build-and-runtime-gates
rec_description:        固定 URL/SHA256；使用 tools.build:compiler_executables；OHOS 编译传递 --target=aarch64-linux-ohos、SDK sysroot 和需要的 libc 宏；安装 bin、man、license；CLI 包在软件级目录声明 commands.json；test_package 用离线最小输入并通过 can_run()/shadow CI 分层验证。
rec_command:            conan create archives/m/metamath/0.198 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               recipe-and-test-package

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      host-only-package-inspection
fallback_description:   没有设备窗口时只能完成源码下载、哈希、交叉编译、ELF、包布局和元数据检查；保留设备测试并标记真机运行证据待补，不能把主机跳过执行视为运行时通过。
fallback_command:       conan create archives/m/metamath/0.198 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          cross-build-with-can-run-skip

forbid_1_pattern:       use-dev-eco-clang-without-sysroot|remove-test-package-because-no-upstream-tests|archives/.*/.*/[0-9].*/commands\.json
forbid_1_reason:        编译器路径、上游测试缺失和 commands.json 位置分别是环境配置、测试设计和软件级元数据问题，不能用互相替代的方式规避。
forbid_1_consequence:   可能生成不可运行的宿主 ELF、缺少消费者验证，或在 R38/L0k 阶段因 commands.json 位置错误直接失败。

principles:             explicit-cross-toolchain, package-boundary, host-device-separation, runtime-evidence
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             DRAFT-pico-sdk-cli-commands-json-r38, DRAFT-ZLIB-SHADOW-CI-HNP-TOOL-PATH
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

